      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>If the viewmodel for a page contains data for both the primary and secondary addresses, both are rendered in the 'confirmed' view. If the addresses are the same, the checkbox for the secondary address is checked.</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2 class=\"govuk-heading-l\">Address</h2>\n<h3 class=\"govuk-heading-m\">Shipping address</h3>\n<p>Tell us where you would you would like your order shipped to.</p>",
